Teruic OS Syscall Exception
---------------------------

NOTE! This restriction does not cover user-space applications that communicate 
with the Teruic OS Kernel using standard system call interfaces or IPC capabilities.

Compiling, linking, or executing user-space software (written in Rust, C, Java, Wasm, etc.) 
on top of Teruic OS does not subject that user software to the terms of the GNU 
